# Netlify (and Cloudflare Pages) header rules.
#
# Cross-origin isolation is what lets the WASM tier use SharedArrayBuffer and
# therefore multiple threads. `credentialless` rather than `require-corp` so the
# model download from Hugging Face still works — that host does not send CORP
# headers, and a fast tier that cannot fetch its weights is worse than a slow one.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
